 achievements are a semifinal in a Grand Slam doubles and a few Olympic appearances, no major singles titles. Provide citations.\n\nNeed JSON with answer string and citations list of [title, sentence_index].\n\nCitations: Serena: \"Williams sisters\" sentence 0 (23 Grand Slam singles), sentence 9 (No.1 ranking), sentence 3 (Wimbledon singles titles). Mariaan: \"Mariaan de Swardt\" sentence 0 (professional 1988-2001) maybe not needed, but we need evidence of her achievements: sentence 2 (Olympics), sentence 2 of 1999 Wimbledon (semifinal). Also \"1998 Boston Cup – Doubles\" sentence 0 (finalist). Provide citations.\n\nLet's list:\n\n- [\"Williams sisters\",0] for 23 Grand Slam singles.\n- [\"Williams sisters\",9] for No.1 ranking.\n- [\"Williams sisters\",3] for Wimbledon singles titles.\n- [\"Mariaan de Swardt\",1] for Olympic representation.\n- [\"1999 Wimbledon Championships – Women's Doubles\",2] for semifinal.\n- [\"1998 Boston Cup – Doubles\",0] for doubles final.\n\nMake answer concise: \"Serena Williams has won 23 Grand Slam singles titles, held the world No. 1 singles ranking and captured multiple Wimbledon singles crowns, whereas Mariaan de Swardt’s best results were representing South Africa at two Olympics and reaching a Grand Slam doubles semifinal (and a doubles final at a WTA event).\" Provide citations.\n\nReturn JSON."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1415,"completion_tokens":746,"total_tokens":2161,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":1792010673,"object":"chat.completion","prompt_filter_results":null}